        "Content": "****AVAILABLE Email Enquiries Only **** \n\nWell presented and recently refurbished two bedroom second floor apartment located in the ever popular Academy Square development, right in the centre of Navan town. This bright and spacious property comes fully furnished and is ready for immediate occupancy.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway with storage, a large open plan living/dining area with fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms (master ensuite) and a main bathroom. The apartment benefits from natural gas central heating and is finished to a high standard throughout.\n\nIdeally positioned within walking distance of Navan Town.\n\nFully furnished ready to move in.\nViewing highly recommended, email enquires references required.\n\nNotice\nAll photographs are provided for guidance only."
      },
